Read these with the two caveats in NOTES.md §3. The pixel counts are not
comparable across sites, because the boxes are different sizes and
Vercel's indicator looks like a background change rather than only a
ring. And this script calls focus() rather than driving Tab, so it
measures whether an indicator appears and not whether a keyboard can
reach the element.
